  era: "Section 2 \xB7 Indus Valley Civilisation \xB7 c. 3300 \u2013 1300 BCE (mature phase c. 2600 \u2013 1900 BCE)"
  title: Weights and measures
  text: Standard cubical weights of chert followed a system that doubled from one to sixty-four and then rose in decimal steps. Measuring scales, including one made of shell from Lothal, show careful and consistent measurement.
